# Testing

- Behavior changes require test updates in the same change.
- Prefer verifying behavior over asserting implementation details.
- Cover filename collision, path validation, error mapping, and unlock success/failure paths.
- Never skip or delete failing tests to force green CI.
- Use synthetic PDF fixtures only.
- Do not claim a feature complete without running the relevant validation.
- Automated tests do **not** replace **Native End-to-End Verification** for Electron main/preload/IPC/dialogs/drag-drop/filesystem/shell/native libs (see `docs/DEVELOPMENT_WORKFLOW.md`).
- Phase Reports must list automated results separately from native Electron manual results.
